=== gh518-muse-model-policy.sh ===
--- positive path: only a confirmed-public repo reaches the discounted tier ---
ok   public repo -> contributor tier
--- fail-closed paths: every uncertainty lands on the clause-free tier ---
ok   private repo -> safe tier
ok   org-internal repo -> safe tier
ok   gh exits nonzero -> safe tier
ok   unparseable visibility -> safe tier
ok   empty visibility -> safe tier
ok   gh not installed -> safe tier
--- timeout must not silently upgrade the tier (bounded, ~15s) ---
ok   gh hangs -> safe tier
